  {
    "text": "- The few most significant events in the flow\n- Often the events with the highest number of domain experts interested\n- can be concrete people or roles\n- event something like 'angry customer' may help\n- IT system outside our own control\n- can belong to another company (e.g. credit card system)\n- can also be internal, but outside scope of our project",
